      "id": "sol.amc-12a-fall-2021-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(2112 - 2021 = 91 = 7 \\cdot 13\\) and \\(169 = 13^2,\\) the fraction is \\(\\dfrac{(7 \\cdot 13)^2}{13^2} = 7^2 = 49.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is C.",
